    {
      "id": "author-reported-quantum-stability",
      "summary": "The source reports anharmonic dynamic stabilization of Fm-3m in the experimental high-pressure range and a LaH10 quantum-energy minimum down to about 129 GPa. These are author model claims, not independent SCLib stability validation.",
