    {
      "id": "lower-pressure-and-isotope-boundaries",
      "summary": "The source reports a LaD10 instability at 126 GPa and loss of LaH10 thermodynamic stability at lower pressure. No table value establishes survival at ambient pressure or a stable host at 300 K and 1 atm.",
